n<p>Tested Parents</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-kjpcwvgg\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nemj9vzs uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>100%</strong></h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-a7ftsugc uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p><strong>KC Standards</strong><br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cjdhbds5 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-d6mv1kbq uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Blue Staffy Health UK</strong>: Our Commitment to Happy, Healthy Puppies</h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-an9ziv7a\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-pommpxim uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Welcome to <a href=\"/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BlueStaffyUK</a>, where the health and well-being of our <strong>blue <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staffordshire_Bull_Terrier\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier</a> puppies</strong> are at the very heart of everything we do. For us, being <strong>licensed blue staffy breeders in the UK, health</strong> is not just a phrase; it’s a foundational principle that guides every aspect of our breeding program. We understand that when you’re looking for where to buy a blue staffy puppy in the UK, you want assurance of their health and longevity.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-n1wgz9ms uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>This page is dedicated to providing transparency about our <a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier health</a>, our rigorous essential health tests for blue Staffordshire Bull Terriers, and how we ensure our puppies receive the best start in life. From genetic screening to comprehensive Staffy puppy health checks before adoption, our goal is to empower you with the knowledge to make an informed decision and prepare for a lifetime of joy with your new companion. For further reading and detailed advice, explore our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-blog-guides/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Staffy blog and guides</a></strong>.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/blue-staffy-uk-breeders/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn About Us</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-8mktsfcc alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-2hfhns2j\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">FAQs: <strong>Blue Staffy Health</strong> &amp; Care</h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Here are some frequently asked questions regarding <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier genetic health</strong> and our breeding practices:</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-2med9pxz uagb-faq-icon-row-reverse uagb-faq-layout-grid uagb-faq-expand-first-false uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-od94ez1z\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Are your puppies health tested for genetic diseases?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Yes. Our parent <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier</strong> dogs are extensively DNA tested and certified <strong>clear</strong> for key hereditary conditions like L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4, which are the primary <strong>hereditary conditions in blue Staffies</strong>. This ensures our <strong>blue Staffy puppies</strong> are free from these specific genetic predispositions.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-ctsfqrbz\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What does L-2-HGA testing mean for my puppy’s health?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p> <strong>L-2-HGA testing</strong> (L-2-Hydroxyglutaric Aciduria) is a crucial <strong>genetic screening for Staffies</strong>. A ‘clear’ result means your puppy will not develop this severe neurological disorder that affects the brain, spinal cord, and muscles. It’s a key indicator of <strong>responsible breeding for health</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-oa5g5jix\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What vaccinations do your puppies have before I take them home?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our <strong>blue Staffy puppies</strong> receive their first set of core <strong>puppy vaccinations UK</strong> (often for Distemper, Parvovirus, Leptospirosis, and Hepatitis) before leaving us, as part of the <strong>UK vaccination schedule for Staffy puppies</strong>. We provide a comprehensive vet-signed health card detailing their vaccination history.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-lvzoj21s\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Do your puppies come with vet records and a health certificate?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Yes, every <strong>KC registered Staffy puppy</strong> comes with a full <strong>blue Staffy health certificate</strong>, including detailed vet records of their initial health check, vaccinations, and deworming schedule. This provides a clear overview of their early <strong>initial veterinary care for puppies</strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-egl4sbdl\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What should I feed my new Staffy puppy for the best diet?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We recommend continuing with the high-quality puppy food your Staffy has been raised on initially (we provide a starter pack). This is crucial for <strong>how to keep my Staffy puppy healthy</strong>. Your vet can provide long-term advice on the <strong>best diet for Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies</strong> based on their individual needs.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-c71957cd\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Do KC registered Staffies have fewer health risks?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Yes. KC registration, combined with breeder DNA testing, reduces the chances of hereditary issues being passed down.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-a77252af\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What is the average lifespan of a Blue Staffy?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>A healthy, well-cared-for <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier</strong> can live <strong>12–14 years</strong>, according to the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staffordshire_Bull_Terrier\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier Club</a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-413c5309\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>How can I avoid buying from a puppy farm?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Always check breeder credentials. Sites like us (BlueStaffyUK) only list <strong>KC-registered Staffy puppies, unlike generic classifieds,</strong> where scams are common.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-g4jlzd3d\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"><p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What does your puppy health guarantee cover, and how long is it?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our <strong>puppy health warranty</strong> is designed to provide you with confidence. It covers specific life-limiting hereditary conditions, including those we test for (L-2-HGA, HC-HSF4). The exact <strong>terms of the health guarantee for dogs</strong> and duration will be clearly outlined in your Puppy Sales Contract.</p></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-6ghd9tbh alignfull uagb-is-root-container\" id=\"Staffy-sale\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-jn7bejmq uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM371.8 211.8C382.7 200.9 382.7 183.1 371.8 172.2C360.9 161.3 343.1 161.3 332.2 172.2L224 280.4L179.8 236.2C168.9 225.3 151.1 225.3 140.2 236.2C129.3 247.1 129.3 264.9 140.2 275.8L204.2 339.8C215.1 350.7 232.9 350.7 243.8 339.8L371.8 211.8z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><span class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\"><strong>Buy Your Blue Staffy Pup Today – Only £850 to £1,200!</strong></span><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Current Litter: 12-Week-Old Blue Staffy Puppies for Sale UK-Wide</strong></h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Looking to purchase Staffordshire Bull Terriers in the UK? Our 12-week-old blue Staffy puppies are healthy, vaccinated, and ready to join your home. £850–£1,200 Price Range.</p>\n<p>Top-quality Staffies at affordable UK family prices. Each Staffy is microchipped and raised with care. Don’t wait—our current litter won’t last long! If you’re seeking reliable, affordable blue Staffy puppies from a trusted source, you’re in the right place.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-n24y3pgl\">\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-7kp569xm alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-4iefplwt uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Understanding <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier Health UK</strong>: Common Concerns</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>The Staffordshire Bull Terrier is, by nature, a <a href=\"/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">robust and resilient breed</a> known for its vitality and affectionate spirit. However, like all breeds, they can be predisposed to certain hereditary health conditions. A reputable blue staffy breeder will be fully transparent about these issues and actively work to minimise their occurrence through careful breeding and inbreeding coefficient (COI) for staffies. </p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-52ea188c uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Some Common Health Concerns in Blue Staffies include:</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Many new owners ask: <em>“Are Blue Staffies prone to health issues?”</em> The truth is, while <strong>KC-registered Staffordshire Bull Terriers</strong> are generally healthy, there are some breed-specific conditions to be aware of.<br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-9ngxwkie alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-zyhlogky\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-4ossv8ki uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>L-2-Hydroxyglutaric Aciduria (L-2-HGA)</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>A neurological disorder affecting metabolism.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-xh628qvi uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Hereditary Cataracts (HC-HSF4)</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>An inherited eye condition that can lead to blindness.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-iswrwkbs uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Patellar Luxation</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>A condition where the kneecap dislocates.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image aligncenter uagb-block-ruq2ijdp wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-center\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A graphic illustrating various diagnostic tools used to perform what health tests do blue Staffies need, including DNA and physical exams.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"495\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/what-health-tests-blue-staffies-need.webp\" srcset=\"/images/what-health-tests-blue-staffies-need.webp 500w\" width=\"500\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-rfwrnnem\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-isnfndsl uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Staffy Skin Allergies</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Blue Staffies are sometimes prone to <strong>skin allergies</strong>. Symptoms include itching, redness, or hair loss. A balanced diet, gentle grooming products, and vet-recommended treatments can help manage these issues.<br/></p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-tesedquf uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Demodectic Mange</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>A skin condition caused by mites, often linked to a suppressed immune system.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-tqyy6j6c uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Why Health Matters in Staffy Breeding</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We follow strict health protocols in line with The Kennel Club (KC) and DEFRA standards to ensure all our puppies are not only beautiful but also physically and mentally sound. Ethical breeding helps reduce hereditary conditions and gives each Staffy puppy the best start in life.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Contact Us</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<p>It’s important to remember that predisposition does not mean a dog will develop these conditions. It simply means a <strong>responsible breeder for health</strong> will screen for them. For broader information on <strong><a href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/shop/dna-testing/the-kennel-club-dna-testing-services-terrier-group/staffordshire-bull-terrier/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier genetic health</a><a href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/breed-health/breeds/terrier/staffordshire-bull-terrier/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">, the Kennel Club</a></strong> is an excellent resource.</p>\n<p>👉 Many families wonder: <em>“How do I know if my Staffy’s skin condition is serious?”</em> A quick call to your vet, backed by resources like <a href=\"https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">VCA Hospitals’ canine health advice</a>, can provide clarity.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-1f5be209 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-ca484dbe\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Staffy Health &amp; Wellness: Join 500+ Pet Parents! </h2></div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-form\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-header\">\n<h3>📬 Get Blue Staffy Updates</h3>\n<p>New litters, breeder tips &amp; puppy availability — straight to your inbox</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-body\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-l00d43sq alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ywn8bwl4\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-0feksguj uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Rigorous <strong>Health Testing Process</strong>: Ensuring Peace of Mind</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>At <a href=\"/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BlueStaffyUK</a>, our proactive approach to the importance of health screening for Staffy parents is central to our reputation as a reliable Staffordshire Bull Terrier breeder in the UK. We go above and beyond the standard, ensuring both our breeding parents, Maggie and Jones, and their puppies are thoroughly screened.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-wtvvuxfp uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>What Health Tests Do Blue Staffies Need? Our Comprehensive Approach</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Before any breeding takes place, our parent dogs undergo extensive veterinary examinations and genetic screenings. This addresses the common query: “<strong>What health checks do you do on your Staffy parents</strong>?”</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xpahnlci\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-iawp0vte wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A blue Staffy puppy receiving a gentle vet check, showcasing our commitment to the health of our pups in the UK.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-vet-check-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-vet-check-uk-760.webp 760w, /images/blue-staffy-puppy-vet-check-uk.webp 1080w\" width=\"1080\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-1o4wrbo3\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xykjuf71\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-opnoccqf uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>BVA/KC Health Schemes</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Our <a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-breeding-dogs-glasgow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">breeding dogs</a> also undergo relevant BVA/KC eye examinations to check for other inherited eye diseases not covered by the HC-HSF4 DNA test, and patella grading to assess knee health.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-zgqw4cwl uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>General Health Checks</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Beyond genetic tests, our parent dogs receive regular veterinary check-ups to ensure they are in peak physical condition. They are free from any other underlying health issues. This forms part of our <strong>DEFRA-approved breeder health checks</strong>.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-yqhumu9t\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-rurdgvev uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4 Tested Staffy Breeders</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>This is non-negotiable for us. Both our beloved Maggie and Jones are DNA tested <strong>clear</strong> for L-2-HGA (L-2-Hydroxyglutaric Aciduria) and HC-HSF4 (Hereditary Cataracts). This means your <strong>KC registered Staffy puppies</strong> will not be genetically affected by these debilitating diseases. “<strong>What does L-2-HGA testing mean</strong>?” It means we’re actively preventing serious neurological and eye conditions through responsible breeding.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-tdevo2xl alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-vyrqst1f\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ljscsqch uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Blue Staffy Puppy Vaccination Schedule UK</strong></h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Your future companion’s health journey continues even after they are born. Every <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> leaving BlueStaffyUK undergoes: </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-gfrut5ny\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-4bwnom0r uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Veterinary Health Examination</strong></h4></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Each pup receives a comprehensive health check by our trusted veterinarian. This includes checking the heart, lungs, eyes, ears, teeth, and general mobility.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-wg9t1anu uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Microchipping Puppies Legal Requirements U</strong>K</h4></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>All puppies are microchipped before leaving, as required by UK law, with the details ready for transfer to the new owner via the <strong><a href=\"https://www.discoverdogs.org.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Petlog microchipping database</a></strong>.</p>\n<p>Since 2016, UK law requires all dogs to be microchipped. This is not optional. <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/get-your-dog-cat-microchipped\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Gov.uk’s microchipping guidance</a> explains the law in detail. At BlueStaffyUK, all puppies come <strong>pre-microchipped and registered</strong> before going to their new homes.</p>\n<p>This ensures that if your dog ever goes missing, you’ll have the best chance of a safe reunion.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nar8xndf uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>First Vaccinations &amp; Health Records</strong></h4></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Addressing “<strong>what vaccinations do your puppies have</strong>?” and “<strong>do puppies come with vet records</strong>?”, all our puppies receive their first set of <strong>recommended vaccinations for Staffy puppies</strong> and come with a detailed vet-signed health card.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ocwpvciv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Deworming and Flea Treatment</strong></h4></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>“<strong>Are your Staffy puppies wormed and flea-treated</strong>?” Yes, our pups follow a strict <strong>deworming protocol</strong> and receive initial flea treatment appropriate for their age, ensuring they are free from parasites.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-xcnnek2n alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-4igedw2v wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"4 blue Staffy puppies looking for a new home in the UK.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"881\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppies-uk-litter1.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppies-uk-litter1-760.webp 760w, /images/blue-staffy-puppies-uk-litter1.webp 889w\" width=\"889\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-zyane3og\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-6l2zeg3s uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>What is included with a KC registered blue staffy puppy</strong>: A Mark of Health and Pedigree</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Choosing <a href=\"/blue-staffy-pup-sale-uk/\"><strong>KC-reg Staffy puppies</strong> from an <strong>ethical Staffy breeder</strong></a> offers a crucial layer of reassurance regarding <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier health tests</strong>. The Kennel Club registration provides:</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ylx1l4do uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-squre\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Verified Pedigree</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Confirmation of your Staffy’s lineage, allowing you to trace generations and verify the health testing of ancestors where records permit.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nsgi3ypf uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-squre\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Breed Standard Adherence</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">KC registration signifies that the parents meet the excellent breed standard, which includes health considerations.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-r7lwuvze uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-squre\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Commitment to Health</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Breeders who register their litters with the KC are often more invested in adhering to health testing recommendations.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-368d188d uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>When you’re looking for “<strong>how to find health-certified Staffy breeders</strong>,” always look for transparency in their <strong>KC-registered</strong> status and health testing results. Explore <a href=\"https://quote.kcinsurance.co.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kennel Club puppy insurance</a></p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Contact Us</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-hmko964k alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-a1mg7ngv\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-jxszd0cv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>UK Vaccination Schedule for Staffy Puppies</strong> and Ongoing Care</h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-qxha7yap uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">One of the most common queries we hear is: <em>“What vaccines does my Blue Staffy need in the UK?”</em> Here’s a simple breakdown:</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Understanding the costs of initial puppy shots, injections, and vaccinations is essential for your blue Staffy’s health. For general advice on <strong><a href=\"https://www.pdsa.org.uk/pet-help-and-advice/pet-health-hub/other-veterinary-advice/dog-vaccines\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">puppy vaccinations UK</a>, the PDSA</strong> offers excellent guidance. </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-dmhklczf wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"UK buyer checking a list of health-certified Staffy breeders\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/find-health-certified-staffy-breeders-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/find-health-certified-staffy-breeders-uk.webp 550w\" width=\"550\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-9ggz1xik\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-lkdwovdn uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Initial Vaccinations</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Our puppy’s first jabs (often for Distemper, Parvovirus, Leptospirosis, Hepatitis) were at around 6-8 weeks old.</p>\n<p>–<strong>8 Weeks:</strong> First vaccinations (distemper, parvovirus, hepatitis, parainfluenza).</p>\n<p>–<strong>12 Weeks:</strong> Second round of vaccinations.</p>\n<p>–<strong>16 Weeks (optional):</strong> Kennel cough.</p>\n<p>–<strong>Annually:</strong> Booster shots and full health check.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-q0ypjjkk uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Second Shot</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Your puppy’s second shots are<br/>typically 2-4 weeks after the first, which you will arrange with your local vet. This completes their initial protection.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-jaxu1b0y uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Boosters</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Annual booster vaccinations are crucial to maintain your Staffy’s immunity throughout their life.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-yyvhuw48 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Parasite Control</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Beyond initial puppy deworming and flea treatment, regular preventative measures are essential. Your vet will advise on ongoing <strong>Staffy puppy worming and flea treatment UK</strong> protocols.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-d7dacf78 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-16875a0b\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-f45ac5ae uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Diet and Nutrition: Fueling Your <strong>Blue Staffy’s Health</strong></h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-753a0b06 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>“<strong>What should I feed my new puppy</strong>?” A high-quality, balanced nutrition for blue Staffy puppies is paramount for your <strong>Staffy puppy’s health</strong> and development.</p>\n<p>Proper nutrition, including finding the best diet for Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies, is key to preventing health issues and supporting strong growth. For more <strong><a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/health/puppycare\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">puppy care tips UK, the RSPCA</a></strong> provides valuable resources.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-556247f0 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Blue Staffy puppy eating veterinarian-recommended puppy food from a clean bowl\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"707\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/what-to-feed-new-blue-staffy-puppy.webp\" srcset=\"/images/what-to-feed-new-blue-staffy-puppy.webp 500w\" width=\"500\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-9bde901b\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-deaff867 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Premium Puppy Food</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Choose a reputable brand of puppy food specifically formulated for medium-sized breeds, as this is generally <strong>good food for Staffies</strong> and helps avoid generic brands with excessive fillers.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-3a0b0d8e uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Feeding Schedule</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Puppies need frequent small meals. We will provide a feeding guide based on their current diet, ensuring a smooth transition.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-780490cb uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Hydration</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Always ensure fresh water is available.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-712a4082 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Avoid Harmful Foods</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Be aware of foods toxic to dogs (e.g., chocolate, grapes, onions).</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-er0py19c alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-bgsbahef uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Regular Health Check for Puppies: A Partnership for Lifetime Health</h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-e3orbafr\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-kc5uucab uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">“<strong>When should I take my puppy to the vet</strong>?” Your first vet visit with your new <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> should be scheduled within <strong>48-72 hours</strong> of bringing them home. This <strong>initial veterinary care for puppies</strong> allows your vet to:</p></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Regular check-ups throughout their life are vital for <strong>keeping my Staffy puppy healthy</strong> and for early detection of any potential issues.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-c6eyww8c\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-h3q9vehn uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Confirm their health post-travel/transition.</p></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-k9lj7uag uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Administer the second vaccination (if due).</p></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-rqhvee4k uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Discuss ongoing <strong>care for Staffy puppies, including</strong> diet and parasite prevention.</p></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-a679d0e8 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-middle\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Establish a relationship for future health needs.</p></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-isejw29i alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-swu43jkw\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-k4hortwx uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Holistic Health &amp; Lifestyle: Beyond the Vet Clinic</strong></h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Maintaining your <strong>blue Staffy’s health</strong> goes beyond genetic testing and routine vet visits. A holistic approach focusing on their daily life is crucial for their physical and mental well-being throughout their lives. This<a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> comprehensive care helps <strong>prevent health issues</strong></a><strong> in puppies</strong> and adult dogs alike.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Contact Us</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-uuw0qges uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Best Exercise for Staffies</strong></h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Staffordshire Bull Terriers are active and athletic dogs, and understanding their <strong>Staffy exercise needs</strong> is crucial. Regular, appropriate exercise, including a dedicated <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier walking</strong> program, is vital for preventing obesity, promoting strong joints, and maintaining a healthy heart. Aim for at least 1-2 hours of daily activity, incorporating brisk walks, energetic playtime, and engaging mental games.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ytc2j5he uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Puppy <strong>Mental Stimulation</strong> </h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>A bored Staffy can become a destructive Staffy, and prolonged boredom can lead to stress-related health issues. Provide puppy mental stimulation toys, mind-stimulating games for puppies, engage in training sessions, and offer interactive playtime to keep their intelligent minds stimulated.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-sptlmu5y uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Staffy <strong>Grooming &amp; Hygiene</strong> </h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>While Staffies have short coats, routine grooming is still important. Regular brushing with the <strong>best dog brush for Staffy</strong> coats helps with overall coat health and manages shedding. Always pay attention to nail trims, ear cleaning, and especially dog dental care UK, as poor dental hygiene can lead to serious health problems.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-688a4bad uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Puppy Proofing your House</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Before your <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> arrives, thoroughly <strong>puppy-proof your home</strong>. Remove toxic plants, secure cleaning products, and eliminate small objects that could be swallowed. Ensure your garden has secure fencing to prevent escapes and exposure to hazards.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-jcspknhm wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A happy blue Staffy puppy engaging with a vet after receiving its puppy vaccinations UK.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"430\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/puppy-vaccinations-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/puppy-vaccinations-uk.webp 500w\" width=\"500\"/></figure></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ed678542 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-e3dab621\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Optimal Staffy Health: Join 500+ for Exclusive Insights!</h2></div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-form\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-header\">\n<h3>📬 Get Blue Staffy Updates</h3>\n<p>New litters, breeder tips &amp; puppy availability — straight to your inbox</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-nl-body\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-gtcgrg7x alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-4ujfgwrg uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Recognizing Early Health Signals: When to Contact Your Vet</strong></h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Being attentive to your <strong>blue Staffy’s health</strong> is key to prompt treatment. While you’ll establish a great relationship with your vet, knowing <strong>when to take your pup to the vet</strong> for common Staffy health issues can make a big difference. Remember, this information is not a substitute for professional veterinary advice, but a guide to help you <strong>recognise puppy health issues</strong> early.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-jemff9gc\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0qlak36w\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-gcxnpqrx uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">01</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Appetite</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"><strong>Changes in Puppy Appetite or Thirst:</strong> A sudden decrease or increase in food or water intake can be a sign of illness.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-l3ivoakv\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-wpga2np2 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">02</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Lethargy</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"><strong>Lethargy or Unusual Tiredness:</strong> If your normally energetic <strong>Staffy puppy</strong> is unusually quiet, listless, or sleeping excessively.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-kl0fiz4c\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-erg96s3a uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">03</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Vomiting</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"><strong>Vomiting or Diarrhoea:</strong> Occasional upset stomachs can happen, but persistent or severe vomiting/diarrhoea, especially with blood, warrants immediate attention.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-rfyijaoh\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-7y1wj3l9 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">04</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Limping</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Puppy <strong>Limping or Difficulty Moving:</strong> Any signs of pain or struggle with movement could indicate a joint issue or injury.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-woq7wwr0\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-xrfjegid uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">05</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Itching</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Excessive itching, licking, or skin redness can be concerning for any owner, especially if you notice your <strong>puppy itchy skin</strong> or <strong>puppy scratching ear</strong> frequently. If your <strong>puppy itching not fleas</strong> is the case, these symptoms can point to allergies, parasites, or skin infections common in Staffordshire Bull Terrier health, and warrant veterinary attention.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-cscmojzf\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-mj4fsijh uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">06</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Coughing</strong></h3></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Puppy coughing, sneezing, or nasal discharge are symptoms to watch out for, as persistent respiratory signs might indicate a cold or, more seriously, <strong>kennel cough in puppies</strong>. Early detection and understanding the appropriate <strong>treatment for kennel cough</strong> are crucial to managing these infections and other potential health issues.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Changes in Urination/Defecation:</strong> Straining, frequent accidents, or unusual colours in urine/stools. If you observe any of these <strong>dog emergency symptoms</strong> or are simply concerned about the <strong>health problems in Staffies</strong>, do not hesitate to <strong><a href=\"https://www.vets4pets.com/find-a-practice/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Your Vet</a></strong> immediately.</p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More</a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-u7wxpdsw alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-uoretsjl wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A cute blue Staffy puppy sitting next to its official Kennel Club registration papers, symbolizing KC registered Staffy puppies.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/kc-registered-staffy-puppies.webp\" srcset=\"/images/kc-registered-staffy-puppies.webp 500w\" width=\"500\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5uuycy62 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our <strong>Blue Staffy Health Certificate</strong> and Health Guarantee</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">We are proud to offer a comprehensive <strong>blue Staffy health certificate</strong> with every puppy, detailing their vaccination records, microchip number, and vet health check results. Furthermore, addressing “<strong>do you offer a health guarantee for your puppies</strong>?” and “<strong>what does your puppy health guarantee cover</strong>?”, we provide a written <strong>puppy health warranty</strong> against life-limiting hereditary conditions for a specified period, as outlined in our Puppy Sale Contract. This reflects our confidence in our breeding practices and our commitment to you. “<strong>How long is your health guarantee</strong>?” The terms of our <strong>guarantee against congenital defects</strong> will be fully explained during your <a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">inquiry</a> process.</p></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-weic3ina alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-uosjrr4f wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A heartwarming photo of Maggie, a beautiful 2-year-old blue Staffy Dam, lovingly tending to her pups.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"585\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/maggie-blue-staffy-dam-with-pups.webp\" srcset=\"/images/maggie-blue-staffy-dam-with-pups-760.webp 760w, /images/maggie-blue-staffy-dam-with-pups.webp 780w\" width=\"780\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-xr8kusqi uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Our Unwavering Health Promise: Why BlueStaffyUK is Your Confident Choice</strong></h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>When you choose a <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> from BlueStaffyUK, you’re not just <strong>buying blue Staffy puppies UK</strong>; you’re investing in a lifetime of healthy companionship. Our dedication to <strong>responsible Staffy breeders’ health</strong> standards is unmatched.</p>\n<p>From rigorous <strong>genetic screening for Staffies</strong> like L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4, to thorough <strong>Staffy puppy health checks before adoption</strong>, and our comprehensive <strong>puppy vaccinations</strong> schedule, every step is taken to ensure your puppy’s well-being.</p>\n<p>We are among the <strong>best blue Staffy breeders in the UK</strong> because we believe in complete transparency and offer a robust <strong>Staffy health guarantee</strong> as part of your <strong>ethical blue Staffy puppy purchase</strong>. Trust us to provide a healthy, happy, and well-adjusted <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppy</strong> that will bring immense joy to your family for years to come.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-b7734f2d alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-a8846c62 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">🐕 Case Study – A Healthy Blue Staffy Journey</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Take Milo, a Blue Staffy from Manchester. His breeder, registered with <a href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">The Kennel Club</a>, provided DNA health certificates, vaccination records, and a microchip ID. Milo’s owners followed advice from the <a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/puppy\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">RSPCA on puppy care</a> and invested in a balanced diet with regular vet visits.</p>\n<p>Two years later, Milo is thriving — a strong, playful Staffy with zero hereditary health issues. This case shows why <strong>choosing the right breeder and following veterinary guidance</strong> makes such a difference.</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ovonbllz alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-kmbz00qv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><span class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\"><strong>What To Do Next</strong></span><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Ready to Welcome a Healthy Blue Staffy Puppy?</strong></h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Choosing a <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> from BlueStaffyUK means choosing a companion whose health and well-being have been prioritised from day one. Our commitment to being <strong>trusted blue Staffy breeders’ health</strong> champions ensures you’re bringing home a happy, robust, and loving family member.</p>\n<p>Learn more about our breeding philosophy on our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-uk-breeders/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">About Blue Staffy UK Breeders</a></strong> page.</p>\n<p>For trusted veterinary insights, consider <strong><a href=\"https://www.vets4pets.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Vets4Pets</a></strong> as a valuable resource for your ongoing pet care needs</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-8qfeuiyq\" id=\"contact-staffy\"> <div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container alignfull uagb-is-root-container bsuk-contact-form-wrap\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-card\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-header\">\n<h2>🐾 Reserve Your Blue Staffy Puppy</h2>\n<p>Fill in your details below and we'll be in touch within 24 hours</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-body\">\n<div class=\"bsuk-form-notice\">⏰ <strong>Delivery Note:</strong> Delivery begins 24–48 hours after payment confirmation. Train station pickup is our default method (free).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n";
